
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="OyisaTech Young Innovators Programme empowers young South Africans through technology, equipment, mentorship and opportunities.">
<title>Young Innovators | OyisaTech</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f5f8ff;
  color: #17233b;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
header {
  background: #071b3a;
  color: white;
  padding: 22px 8%;
}
.logo {
  font-size: 25px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #55b7ff;
}
nav {
  margin-top: 12px;
}
nav a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-right: 18px;
  font-size: 14px;
}
.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg,#071b3a,#0755a5);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 85px 20px;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-size: 36px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}
.hero p {
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: auto;
  color: #e2edff;
}
.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #22a7f0;
  color: white;
  padding: 13px 25px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-top: 25px;
  font-weight: bold;
}
section {
  padding: 55px 8%;
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: auto;
}
h2 {
  color: #0755a5;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 25px;
}
.card {
  background: white;
  padding: 25px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
}
.card h3 {
  color: #0755a5;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.goal {
  background: #e4f2ff;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 35px 20px;
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.number {
  font-size: 55px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #0876c9;
}
.partner {
  background: #071b3a;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 55px 20px;
}
.partner h2 {
  color: white;
}
footer {
  background: #041329;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  font-size: 14px;
}
footer a {
  color: #55b7ff;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">OYISATECH</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#mission">Our Mission</a>
    <a href="#partners">Partners</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>Young Innovators Programme</h1>
  <p>
    Empowering the next generation of South African
    technology creators. Your talent deserves an opportunity.
  </p>
  <a href="#about" class="btn">Discover Our Mission</a>
</div>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About Our Programme</h2>
  <p>
    The OyisaTech Young Innovators Programme is an initiative
    dedicated to supporting young South Africans who want to
    enter the technology industry or establish technology
    businesses but lack the resources to get started.
  </p>
  <p>
    We believe that a lack of equipment should not prevent
    talented young people from pursuing their dreams.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="goal">
    <div class="number">5</div>
    <h2>Our First-Year Goal</h2>
    <p>
      Our initial target is to support five young innovators
      in Gauteng, South Africa.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="mission">
  <h2>Who We Want to Support</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Aspiring Developers</h3>
      <p>
        Young people interested in learning programming,
        software development and creating mobile applications.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Young Entrepreneurs</h3>
      <p>
        Young people who have started technology businesses
        and need resources to grow.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Young Innovators</h3>
      <p>
        Creative individuals with technology ideas who lack
        equipment and support to bring them to life.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>How We Want to Make a Difference</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>💻 Laptop Donations</h3>
      <p>Providing donated and refurbished laptops to deserving young innovators.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>🎓 Digital Skills</h3>
      <p>Connecting young people with digital learning and training opportunities.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>🤝 Mentorship</h3>
      <p>Connecting aspiring creators with experienced technology professionals.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>🚀 Business Support</h3>
      <p>Helping young technology entrepreneurs develop and grow their ideas.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="partner" id="partners">
  <h2>Become a Partner</h2>
  <p>
    We invite companies, organisations, technology
    professionals and individuals to support our mission.
    Your contribution could help a young person take their
    first step into technology.
  </p>
  <a href="mailto:info@oyisatech.co.za" class="btn">
    Partner With Us
  </a>
  <p style="font-size:13px;margin-top:12px;">
    Please contact us through our verified OyisaTech contact channels.
  </p>
</section>

<footer>
  <p><strong>OYISATECH</strong></p>
  <p>Dream. Build. Grow.</p>
  <p>Empowering young people through technology.</p>
  <p><a href="https://oyisatech.github.io/">Visit OyisaTech</a></p>
  <p>&copy; 2026 OyisaTech. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
